  "[action] The second son sets up his grain market.",
  "[action] sets up grain market",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) asks eldest son",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now what is your life like in the town with the rich merchants?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son welcomes his father and invites him to the city.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, it is a good life and a busy one, but there is the city and we have a great house and a garden and many guests and we are not so poor as you were.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"So be it, my son. I am glad you are not poor. But what do you eat in the town?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We eat well in the town,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what kind of meat do you eat?\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Pigeons or ducks or geese?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"And what of you?\"",
  "[action] The second son answers his father.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Ah, we eat whatever we can afford,\"",
  "[action] The sons help their father with farm work.",
